    camp_sub: "Version 2.3.0, coming soon, focuses on four core improvements: a more stable connection that recovers automatically after an interruption; one sign-in with direct access to all features; fully upgraded core components for smoother operation; and a real-time, clear remote picture that feels like working at the machine itself.",
    camp_ver_pre: "Version", camp_ver_post: "coming soon",
    camp_sync: "Windows, Android, and Web updated together",
    camp_view: "See what this update focuses on",
    camp_note: "The current version remains available for download. After the new version is released, installed users can update directly within the software. Full release notes will be published in the changelog on this page at release time.",
    camp_chip_b: "Automatic reconnection after a drop",
    camp_n1l: "Maximum sign-in persistence", camp_n2l: "Sign in once to use all features", camp_n3l: "Windows, Android, and Web updated together",
    camp_hl_kicker: "This Update", camp_hl_title: "The 2.0 update focuses on four things only",
    camp_hl_lead: "Version 2.3.0, coming soon, does not chase feature counts. It concentrates on the four matters that affect everyday use the most. Smaller refinements will be recorded in the changelog on this page at release time and are not listed here one by one.",
